{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tiny idle defense game about mining crystals and defending your wall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your base is under siege! As the keeper, you mine crystals while fighting off endless waves of enemies. You'll upgrade your defenses, boost your mining efficiency, and unlock powerful abilities as you see how long you can survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every few waves, pick from three random permanent upgrades that shape your strategy. Will you become an unstoppable warrior who barely needs walls? A mining tycoon with impenetrable automated defenses? Or find your own path to survival?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you find the perfect balance between gathering resources and defending your walls?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768580/extras/cooltext483613621783596.png?t=1752040460\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768580/extras/mininggif-ezgif.com-overlay__5_.gif?t=1752040460\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768580/extras/cooltext483614139885101__1_.png?t=1752040460\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768580/extras/defendinggif-ezgif.com-overlay__5_.gif?t=1752040460\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768580/extras/cooltext483613496326302.png?t=1752040460\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768580/extras/input-ezgif.com-overlay__2_.gif?t=1752040460\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768580/extras/upgradeshop2-ezgif.com-overlay__1_.gif?t=1752040460\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And of course, don't die...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768580/extras/death-ezgif.com-overlay.gif?t=1752040460\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f Dual gameplay - mine crystals while defending your castle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc8e 6+ different upgrade paths to develop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udff0 Turrets, auto-drills, and defensive structures to build</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcc8 Idle progression with active gameplay elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0a Endless waves with increasing difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf Permanent upgrade choices every few waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u23f0 1-2 hours to reach late game content</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768580?t=1752040460","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768580/dfd5cc01995525245c4eedbb5e507b27a03fcb52/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752040460","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/37